# UNICEF Evaluation Forms

Digitize **only** these official instruments. Item copy lives in `src/content/frameworks/`. Version instruments; never overwrite submitted scores.

| Code | Document | Who submits |
| FORM_1 | School/Kindergarten Evaluation Form (Form No. 1) | FIELD_MONITOR (official); COUNCIL_MEMBER (Parents & Teachers Council section only) |
| FORM_2 | School Development Plan (Form No. 2) | FIELD_MONITOR; KINDERGARTEN_MANAGER for their site |

## Eight sections (both forms)

1. Building (بالەخانە)
2. Water & Sanitation (ئاو و ئاودەست)
3. Canteen / Store (فروشگا / حانووت)
4. Educational & Learning Environment (ژینگەی پەروەردە و فێرکردن)
5. Teachers (مامۆستایان)
6. School Administration (بەڕێوەبەرایەتی قوتابخانه)
7. Curricula & Programs (پرۆگرامەکان)
8. Parents & Teachers Council (ئنجومەنی دایباب و مامۆستایان)

Form 1 scores each indicator (1–4 or NA). Form 2 turns gaps into timed, owned actions per section. Labels are trilingual; scores stay numeric.
